## Navigation and Search Guidance

- Use semantic search to find concepts (e.g., authentication, permissions) across Rails and Angular.
- Prefer exact text search when you know identifiers (class/module/function names).
- For Rails code, cross-reference models, services, and controllers by namespace and file path.
- For Angular code, search by module and component names; respect lazy-loaded boundaries.
- Before editing, scan related specs in `spec/` or `*.spec.ts` to understand behavior and guardrails.
- Keep edits minimal and localized; follow the existing patterns and naming conventions.
